      "locked": true,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1. Riders should be able to input a start location and a destination and get a\nfare estimate\n2. Riders should be able to request a ride based on the estimated fare\n3. Drivers should be able to accept/decline a request and navigate to pickup/drop-off",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Riders should be able to input a start location and a destination and get a\nfare estimate\n2. Riders should be able to request a ride based on the estimated fare\n3. Drivers should be able to accept/decline a request and navigate to pickup/drop-off",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 94,
      "index": "a8",
      "autoResize": true
    },
