      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- CAP: Availability > Consistnecy - for ride estimate\n- CAP: Consistency > Availability - for actual booking with a driver and pricing\n- High Read Scalability in general, for viewing information about rides and fares\n- Fast matching less than 1 minute ideally\n- High scaling for surge times, like major events",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- CAP: Availability > Consistnecy - for ride estimate\n- CAP: Consistency > Availability - for actual booking with a driver and pricing\n- High Read Scalability in general, for viewing information about rides and fares\n- Fast matching less than 1 minute ideally\n- High scaling for surge times, like major events",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 115,
      "index": "aC",
